title: 'Decided: the server, not the client, says "No other containers.", as a save-result warning.'
pid: 427e06be-b8a2-432c-8093-08c8c355e3bc
body: |2-
  Libby's question. Every client already shows those warnings, so Elle need build
  nothing; she may choose to show this one in the echo area rather than the
  warnings buffer, by its text. Why, in my note "The refresh reports nothing, so
  what a request drew is judged around it, in the rerender pass." It also fires
  for a node nothing contains at all, which is as true.
